WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.735 --> 00:00:15.258
Hank Tank rolled toward Roxy.

2
00:00:15.258 --> 00:00:17.261
Whiz-hoo!

3
00:00:17.261 --> 00:00:20.971
She fired her eye laser beams at one of his rubber treads.

4
00:00:20.971 --> 00:00:26.202
Boom! The tread exploded.

5
00:00:26.202 --> 00:00:28.400
Roxy jumped to her feet.

6
00:00:28.401 --> 00:00:29.840
Hank tried to roll.

7
00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.204
But the tread was broken, and he couldn't move.

8
00:00:33.204 --> 00:00:35.764
Smoke poured out from under him.

9
00:00:35.764 --> 00:00:40.722
"Human mode!" shouted Hank.

10
00:00:40.722 --> 00:00:44.462
Parts shifted and moved.

11
00:00:44.462 --> 00:00:50.938
Hank stood up again.

12
00:00:50.938 --> 00:00:52.804
He glared at Roxy.

13
00:00:52.804 --> 00:00:56.945
"You'll regret breaking my tank, Rocket Girl!"

14
00:00:56.945 --> 00:01:01.045
Hank Tank charged. He slammed into Roxy.

15
00:01:01.045 --> 00:01:04.316
Bam! They knocked over a bus.

16
00:01:04.316 --> 00:01:07.151
"Ahh!" cried the bus driver.

17
00:01:07.151 --> 00:01:09.382
"Sorry!" said Roxy.

18
00:01:09.382 --> 00:01:13.224
She quickly put the bus back on its wheels.

19
00:01:13.225 --> 00:01:15.627
Hank slammed into Roxy again.

20
00:01:15.627 --> 00:01:19.172
Bam! The bus fell over again.

21
00:01:19.172 --> 00:01:23.157
"Ahh!" cried the bus driver again.

22
00:01:23.158 --> 00:01:25.541
Roxy jumped to her feet and punched.

23
00:01:25.542 --> 00:01:28.777
Crack! Hank Tank flew backward.

24
00:01:28.778 --> 00:01:31.110
"Oof!" cried Hank.

25
00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:33.524
He crashed through a store window.

26
00:01:33.524 --> 00:01:37.219
Roxy set the bus back up.

27
00:01:37.219 --> 00:01:41.138
Then she saw Hank charging toward her again.

28
00:01:41.138 --> 00:01:42.916
Roxy made a fist.

29
00:01:42.916 --> 00:01:45.677
As Hank slammed into her, she punched.

30
00:01:45.677 --> 00:01:48.305
Roxy and Hank both flew backward.

31
00:01:48.305 --> 00:01:51.607
Again Roxy slammed into the bus.

32
00:01:51.607 --> 00:01:55.231
"Ahh!" cried the bus driver.

33
00:01:55.231 --> 00:01:57.335
"Ugh!" thought Roxy.

34
00:01:57.335 --> 00:02:00.161
"How am I going to stop Hank Tank?"

35
00:02:00.161 --> 00:02:04.358
As Roxy tried to get up, Hank's big foot came down.

36
00:02:04.358 --> 00:02:11.962
"I'm going to squash you, Rocket Girl!" Hank laughed.

37
00:02:11.962 --> 00:02:14.066
Roxy rolled out of the way.

38
00:02:14.066 --> 00:02:18.110
Stomp! Hank's foot cracked the pavement.

39
00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:22.261
Roxy noticed Hank's large round shell.

40
00:02:22.261 --> 00:02:25.177
"I have an idea," she thought.

41
00:02:25.177 --> 00:02:27.408
Hank's foot came down again.

42
00:02:27.408 --> 00:02:30.206
Roxy grabbed the foot and flung it up.

43
00:02:30.206 --> 00:02:33.601
Hank fell backward, landing on his round shell.

44
00:02:33.601 --> 00:02:36.187
Hank waved his arms and legs.

45
00:02:36.187 --> 00:02:40.844
But he was stuck lying on his back, like a turtle.

46
00:02:40.844 --> 00:02:45.468
"Help!" cried the villain. "I can't get up!"

47
00:02:45.468 --> 00:02:49.643
Detective Smith arrived with some other police officers.

48
00:02:49.643 --> 00:02:56.702
Roxy smiled. "You can take Hank to jail, Detective!"

49
00:02:56.702 --> 00:03:01.701
The next day Roxy and her friends were in the school garden again.

50
00:03:01.701 --> 00:03:05.427
Mr. Green handed out gloves.

51
00:03:05.427 --> 00:03:07.657
"Hey, look!" said Mara.

52
00:03:07.657 --> 00:03:10.194
She pointed at the opposite side of the garden.

53
00:03:10.194 --> 00:03:12.472
"It's a pond!"

54
00:03:12.472 --> 00:03:16.502
"Cool!" said Jack.

55
00:03:16.503 --> 00:03:19.400
"It looks like a big turtle shell."

56
00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.739
Mr. Green chuckled.

57
00:03:21.739 --> 00:03:24.978
"That shell was part of a bad guy's armor.

58
00:03:24.978 --> 00:03:27.642
He robbed a bank yesterday.

59
00:03:27.642 --> 00:03:30.527
Luckily, Rocket Girl caught him.

60
00:03:30.527 --> 00:03:34.917
She gave the shell to the school."

61
00:03:34.917 --> 00:03:37.905
Terrell grinned. "See, Roxy?

62
00:03:37.905 --> 00:03:41.975
I knew Rocket Girl could get us a pond!"

63
00:03:41.975 --> 00:03:44.265
Roxy didn't say anything.

64
00:03:44.265 --> 00:03:50.854
She just put on her gloves and started to dig.
